'''Yam Seeds''' are a type of seed. Mature plants yield [[Yam]]s.

They can be purchased at [[Pierre's General Store]], at [[JojaMart]], from the Magic Shop Boat at the [[Night Market]] on Winter 17, and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]]. They can also be obtained by using the [[Seed Maker]].  Five to twenty Yam Seeds may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern.

